   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 0.0,
     "end": 4.82,
     "text": "Every AI model you used this year turns every word into geometry."
    },
    {
     "start": 4.82,
     "end": 6.36,
     "text": "Not as a metaphor."
    },
    {
     "start": 6.36,
     "end": 9.84,
     "text": "Each word becomes a point, with real coordinates."
    },
    {
     "start": 9.84,
     "end": 11.36,
     "text": "Take the point for king,"
    },
    {
     "start": 11.36,
     "end": 13.3,
     "text": "subtract man, add woman,"
    },
    {
     "start": 13.3,
     "end": 16.58,
     "text": "and you land almost exactly on queen."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M02_MAP_CLUSTERS",
   "start": 16.58,
   "end": 32.08,
   "duration": 15.5,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 16.58,
     "end": 18.54,
     "text": "Nobody typed that rule in."
    },
    {
     "start": 18.54,
     "end": 23.72,
     "text": "The machine found it by itself, in billions of sentences written by people."
    },
    {
     "start": 23.72,
     "end": 25.7,
     "text": "So what is this map,"
    },
    {
     "start": 25.7,
     "end": 27.8,
     "text": "and what else did it pick up from us?"
    },
    {
     "start": 27.8,
     "end": 32.08,
     "text": "Get comfortable, this one is worth going slowly."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "engine": "Flow",
   "asset": "F1_MAINFRAME_1954",
   "start": 32.08,
   "end": 35.16,
   "duration": 3.08,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 32.08,
     "end": 35.16,
     "text": "January 1954, New York."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "engine": "Remotion",
   "asset": "R1_GEORGETOWN_CARD",
   "start": 35.16,
   "end": 54.64,
   "duration": 19.48,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 35.16,
     "end": 41.16,
     "text": "An IBM 701 computer translates more than sixty Russian sentences into English,"
    },
    {
     "start": 41.16,
     "end": 43.32,
     "text": "live, in front of the press."
    },
    {
     "start": 43.32,
     "end": 45.46,
     "text": "The system knew 250 words"
    },
    {
     "start": 45.46,
     "end": 47.76,
     "text": "and six rules of grammar."
    },
    {
     "start": 47.76,
     "end": 48.86,
     "text": "The researchers predicted"
    },
    {
     "start": 48.86,
     "end": 53.24,
     "text": "machine translation would be a solved problem within three to five years."
    },
    {
     "start": 53.24,
     "end": 54.64,
     "text": "It was not."
    }
   ],
   "moved_in_beats": 2
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "engine": "Remotion",
   "asset": "R2_ALPAC_1966",
   "start": 54.64,
   "end": 69.32,
   "duration": 14.68,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 54.64,
     "end": 60.76,
     "text": "In 1966, a U.S. government committee called ALPAC reviewed a decade of work."
    },
    {
     "start": 60.76,
     "end": 64.56,
     "text": "Its verdict: machine translation was slower than humans,"
    },
    {
     "start": 64.56,
     "end": 65.56,
     "text": "less accurate,"
    },
    {
     "start": 65.56,
     "end": 67.62,
     "text": "and about twice as expensive."
    },
    {
     "start": 67.62,
     "end": 69.32,
     "text": "Funding collapsed."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M04_RULES_PILE",
   "start": 69.32,
   "end": 76.5,
   "duration": 7.18,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 69.32,
     "end": 72.8,
     "text": "The fix, for decades, was more rules."
    },
    {
     "start": 72.8,
     "end": 73.66,
     "text": "It worked in demos,"
    },
    {
     "start": 73.66,
     "end": 76.5,
     "text": "and broke on real sentences."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "engine": "html_motion",
   "asset": "HM1_ONE_HOT_SCROLL",
   "start": 76.5,
   "end": 91.78,
   "duration": 15.28,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 76.5,
     "end": 79.44,
     "text": "Underneath, a word was just a label."
    },
    {
     "start": 79.44,
     "end": 83.02,
     "text": "One common scheme gives every word its own slot."
    },
    {
     "start": 83.02,
     "end": 89.64,
     "text": "For a vocabulary the size of GPT-3's, that is 50,257 slots,"
    },
    {
     "start": 89.64,
     "end": 91.78,
     "text": "all zeros except one."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M03_EQUAL_DISTANCE",
   "start": 91.78,
   "end": 103.46,
   "duration": 11.68,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 91.78,
     "end": 93.48,
     "text": "Here is the problem."
    },
    {
     "start": 93.48,
     "end": 97.64,
     "text": "In that system, hotel and motel are exactly as far apart"
    },
    {
     "start": 97.64,
     "end": 99.82,
     "text": "as hotel and banana."
    },
    {
     "start": 99.82,
     "end": 103.46,
     "text": "Every word sits at the same distance from every other word."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 9,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M03B_NO_SIMILARITY",
   "start": 103.46,
   "end": 116.8,
   "duration": 13.34,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 103.46,
     "end": 107.2,
     "text": "So the math has no way to say these two belong together."
    },
    {
     "start": 107.2,
     "end": 109.34,
     "text": "Ask it how similar any two words are,"
    },
    {
     "start": 109.34,
     "end": 112.98,
     "text": "and the answer is always the same: zero."
    },
    {
     "start": 112.98,
     "end": 116.8,
     "text": "That is why sixty years of rules kept hitting a wall."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 10,
   "engine": "Remotion",
   "asset": "R3_TIMELINE_1957",
   "start": 116.8,
   "end": 129.06,
   "duration": 12.26,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 116.8,
     "end": 121.14,
     "text": "The way out had been sitting in plain sight since 1957."
    },
    {
     "start": 121.14,
     "end": 124.08,
     "text": "It came from a linguist, not an engineer."
    },
    {
     "start": 124.08,
     "end": 129.06,
     "text": "John Rupert Firth wrote one sentence that the whole field would later build on."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M05_FIRTH_QUOTE",
   "start": 129.06,
   "end": 138.86,
   "duration": 9.8,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 129.06,
     "end": 132.4,
     "text": "You shall know a word by the company it keeps."
    },
    {
     "start": 132.4,
     "end": 136.68,
     "text": "Meaning, in other words, is not stored inside a word."
    },
    {
     "start": 136.68,
     "end": 138.86,
     "text": "It is a pattern of neighbors."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 12,
   "engine": "html_motion",
   "asset": "HM2_FILL_BLANK",
   "start": 138.86,
   "end": 148.6,
   "duration": 9.74,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 138.86,
     "end": 142.6,
     "text": "Try it. I drank a hot cup of blank."
    },
    {
     "start": 142.6,
     "end": 144.4,
     "text": "You already know the answers:"
    },
    {
     "start": 144.4,
     "end": 146.98,
     "text": "coffee, tea, maybe cocoa."
    },
    {
     "start": 146.98,
     "end": 148.6,
     "text": "Never banana."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 13,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M06_CONTEXT_PULL",
   "start": 148.6,
   "end": 164.26,
   "duration": 15.66,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 148.6,
     "end": 152.18,
     "text": "Words that show up in the same places are probably related."
    },
    {
     "start": 152.18,
     "end": 154.4,
     "text": "So give each word a list of numbers,"
    },
    {
     "start": 154.4,
     "end": 156.72,
     "text": "and start those numbers at random."
    },
    {
     "start": 156.72,
     "end": 158.94,
     "text": "Then read real text."
    },
    {
     "start": 158.94,
     "end": 161.98,
     "text": "Every time two words appear in similar company,"
    },
    {
     "start": 161.98,
     "end": 164.26,
     "text": "nudge their numbers a little closer."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 14,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M06B_PUSH_APART",
   "start": 164.26,
   "end": 181.5,
   "duration": 17.24,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 164.26,
     "end": 169.12,
     "text": "But if you only pull things together, everything collapses into one blob."
    },
    {
     "start": 169.12,
     "end": 171.46,
     "text": "So the trick has a second half."
    },
    {
     "start": 171.46,
     "end": 174.62,
     "text": "Pick a few random words, like banana or volcano,"
    },
    {
     "start": 174.62,
     "end": 176.48,
     "text": "and push those away."
    },
    {
     "start": 176.48,
     "end": 179.86,
     "text": "Pull the real neighbors in, push the random ones out,"
    },
    {
     "start": 179.86,
     "end": 181.5,
     "text": "millions of times."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 15,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M06D_CONTEXT_WINDOW",
   "start": 181.5,
   "end": 194.1,
   "duration": 12.6,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 181.5,
     "end": 183.58,
     "text": "How close counts as company?"
    },
    {
     "start": 183.58,
     "end": 187.54,
     "text": "A small window, usually a handful of words on either side."
    },
    {
     "start": 187.54,
     "end": 190.06,
     "text": "Slide that window across every sentence,"
    },
    {
     "start": 190.06,
     "end": 191.18,
     "text": "one word at a time,"
    },
    {
     "start": 191.18,
     "end": 194.1,
     "text": "and you have your training data, for free."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 16,
   "engine": "Flow",
   "asset": "F2_PAPER_ARCHIVE",
   "start": 194.1,
   "end": 201.24,
   "duration": 7.14,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 194.1,
     "end": 198.1,
     "text": "In 2013, a team at Google led by Tomas Mikolov"
    },
    {
     "start": 198.1,
     "end": 201.24,
     "text": "ran that idea at a scale nobody had tried."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 17,
   "engine": "Remotion",
   "asset": "R4_SCALE_COUNTERS",
   "start": 201.24,
   "end": 216.16,
   "duration": 14.92,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 201.24,
     "end": 203.16,
     "text": "They called it word2vec."
    },
    {
     "start": 203.16,
     "end": 207.08,
     "text": "Their public model read about a hundred billion words of news."
    },
    {
     "start": 207.08,
     "end": 209.98,
     "text": "It ended with three million words and phrases,"
    },
    {
     "start": 209.98,
     "end": 213.64,
     "text": "each one stored as a list of 300 numbers."
    },
    {
     "start": 213.64,
     "end": 216.16,
     "text": "Three hundred coordinates per word."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 18,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M06C_SIDE_EFFECT",
   "start": 216.16,
   "end": 236.96,
   "duration": 20.8,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 216.16,
     "end": 217.46,
     "text": "Here is the strange part."
    },
    {
     "start": 217.46,
     "end": 220.62,
     "text": "The model was trained on a task nobody cared about:"
    },
    {
     "start": 220.62,
     "end": 223.0,
     "text": "guessing which words sit near which."
    },
    {
     "start": 223.0,
     "end": 226.26,
     "text": "When training finished, the guessing part was thrown away."
    },
    {
     "start": 226.26,
     "end": 228.54,
     "text": "What they kept was the side effect:"
    },
    {
     "start": 228.54,
     "end": 230.52,
     "text": "the numbers for each word."
    },
    {
     "start": 230.52,
     "end": 233.46,
     "text": "Like walking a city every day to run errands."
    },
    {
     "start": 233.46,
     "end": 234.78,
     "text": "The errands end."
    },
    {
     "start": 234.78,
     "end": 236.96,
     "text": "The map in your head stays."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 19,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M07_300D_TO_3D",
   "start": 236.96,
   "end": 248.92,
   "duration": 11.96,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 236.96,
     "end": 239.76,
     "text": "Nobody can picture 300 dimensions."
    },
    {
     "start": 239.76,
     "end": 243.68,
     "text": "But squash them down to three, and the cloud is not random."
    },
    {
     "start": 243.68,
     "end": 245.62,
     "text": "Countries gather in one region."
    },
    {
     "start": 245.62,
     "end": 246.92,
     "text": "Foods in another."
    },
    {
     "start": 246.92,
     "end": 248.92,
     "text": "Verbs of motion in another."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 20,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M07B_NO_NAMED_AXIS",
   "start": 248.92,
   "end": 263.14,
   "duration": 14.22,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 248.92,
     "end": 252.0,
     "text": "So does number seventeen mean animal?"
    },
    {
     "start": 252.0,
     "end": 252.58,
     "text": "No."
    },
    {
     "start": 252.58,
     "end": 255.66,
     "text": "No single number means anything you could name."
    },
    {
     "start": 255.66,
     "end": 258.94,
     "text": "Meaning is spread across all 300 at once,"
    },
    {
     "start": 258.94,
     "end": 263.14,
     "text": "and it shows up as directions through the space, not as axes."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 21,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M08_COSINE_ANGLE",
   "start": 263.14,
   "end": 277.24,
   "duration": 14.1,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 263.14,
     "end": 267.88,
     "text": "To measure closeness, these models usually skip the ruler and use the angle."
    },
    {
     "start": 267.88,
     "end": 270.52,
     "text": "Draw an arrow from the center to each word."
    },
    {
     "start": 270.52,
     "end": 272.44,
     "text": "A small angle means similar."
    },
    {
     "start": 272.44,
     "end": 274.62,
     "text": "A wide angle means unrelated."
    },
    {
     "start": 274.62,
     "end": 277.24,
     "text": "It is called cosine similarity."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 22,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M09_DIRECTION_TEASE",
   "start": 277.24,
   "end": 284.32,
   "duration": 7.08,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 277.24,
     "end": 280.28,
     "text": "Then the team noticed something they had not asked for."
    },
    {
     "start": 280.28,
     "end": 281.86,
     "text": "The positions mattered."
    },
    {
     "start": 281.86,
     "end": 284.32,
     "text": "But so did the directions between them."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 23,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M10_KING_QUEEN",
   "start": 284.32,
   "end": 299.58,
   "duration": 15.26,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 284.32,
     "end": 285.66,
     "text": "Start at king."
    },
    {
     "start": 285.66,
     "end": 288.62,
     "text": "Walk along the arrow that runs from man to woman."
    },
    {
     "start": 288.62,
     "end": 291.48,
     "text": "The nearest word to where you stop is queen."
    },
    {
     "start": 291.48,
     "end": 295.38,
     "text": "One honest detail: the starting words are left out of that search,"
    },
    {
     "start": 295.38,
     "end": 297.46,
     "text": "or king itself would often win."
    },
    {
     "start": 297.46,
     "end": 299.58,
     "text": "But the direction is real."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 24,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M11_PARALLEL_ARROWS",
   "start": 299.58,
   "end": 316.9,
   "duration": 17.32,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 299.58,
     "end": 301.68,
     "text": "The same move works for capitals."
    },
    {
     "start": 301.68,
     "end": 305.28,
     "text": "France to Paris points the same way as Italy to Rome."
    },
    {
     "start": 305.28,
     "end": 306.7,
     "text": "It works for grammar."
    },
    {
     "start": 306.7,
     "end": 311.12,
     "text": "Walking to walked runs roughly parallel to swimming to swam."
    },
    {
     "start": 311.12,
     "end": 314.3,
     "text": "Nobody wrote a rule for capitals or past tense."
    },
    {
     "start": 314.3,
     "end": 316.9,
     "text": "They fell out of the statistics."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 25,
   "engine": "Remotion",
   "asset": "R5_ANALOGY_TEST",
   "start": 316.9,
   "end": 334.7,
   "duration": 17.8,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 316.9,
     "end": 318.16,
     "text": "Mikolov's team measured it."
    },
    {
     "start": 318.16,
     "end": 322.36,
     "text": "They wrote 19,544 analogy questions."
    },
    {
     "start": 322.36,
     "end": 325.08,
     "text": "One of their models, trained on six billion words,"
    },
    {
     "start": 325.08,
     "end": 328.62,
     "text": "got about 55 percent of the meaning questions right,"
    },
    {
     "start": 328.62,
     "end": 330.92,
     "text": "and 59 percent of the grammar ones."
    },
    {
     "start": 330.92,
     "end": 331.96,
     "text": "Not perfect."
    },
    {
     "start": 331.96,
     "end": 334.7,
     "text": "But nobody had taught it a single fact."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 26,
   "engine": "Remotion",
   "asset": "R6_GLOVE_2014",
   "start": 334.7,
   "end": 355.62,
   "duration": 20.92,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 334.7,
     "end": 339.66,
     "text": "A year later, a team at Stanford tried a different route, called GloVe."
    },
    {
     "start": 339.66,
     "end": 341.06,
     "text": "No guessing game."
    },
    {
     "start": 341.06,
     "end": 344.04,
     "text": "It simply counted how often words appear near each other"
    },
    {
     "start": 344.04,
     "end": 346.5,
     "text": "across a huge pile of text."
    },
    {
     "start": 346.5,
     "end": 348.66,
     "text": "The same directions appeared."
    },
    {
     "start": 348.66,
     "end": 350.3,
     "text": "That was the tell."
    },
    {
     "start": 350.3,
     "end": 353.42,
     "text": "The geometry was not a quirk of one algorithm."
    },
    {
     "start": 353.42,
     "end": 355.62,
     "text": "It was in the language itself."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 27,
   "engine": "Flow",
   "asset": "F3_PRINTING_PRESS",
   "start": 355.62,
   "end": 362.22,
   "duration": 6.6,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 355.62,
     "end": 357.96,
     "text": "But if the geometry lives in the language,"
    },
    {
     "start": 357.96,
     "end": 362.22,
     "text": "it carries everything people wrote, including what they assume."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "scene": 28,
   "engine": "Manim",
   "asset": "M12_BIAS_ARROW",
   "start": 362.22,
   "end": 380.08,
   "duration": 17.86,
   "beats": [
    {
     "start": 362.22,
     "end": 366.62,
     "text": "In 2016, researchers from Boston University and Microsoft Research"
