     "start": 366.62,
     "end": 370.26,
     "text": "ran the same arithmetic on those Google News vectors."
    },
    {
     "start": 370.26,
     "end": 372.08,
     "text": "Man is to computer programmer"
    },
    {
     "start": 372.08,
     "end": 373.64,
     "text": "as woman is to…"
    },
    {
     "start": 373.64,
     "end": 375.44,
     "text": "homemaker."
    },
    {
     "start": 375.44,
     "end": 377.18,
     "text": "The map had learned a stereotype"
    },
    {
     "start": 377.18,
     "end": 380.08,
     "text": "with the same precision it learned capitals."
